{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike mainstream desktop wallpaper effect programs, ForepaperEngine is an application that displays frontend content at the topmost layer of your desktop. This means it overlays a fully transparent, full-featured browser engine window above all your application windows, which provides 100% support for mainstream frontend technologies like HTML/CSS/JS, enabling personalized content development based on these standard web technologies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751130?t=1747928622","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751130?t=1747928622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751130/70800a7731365ea7d064d30d8a6fcf8923e793f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747928622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751130/70800a7731365ea7d064d30d8a6fcf8923e793f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747928622","categories":[{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike mainstream desktop wallpaper effect programs, ForepaperEngine is an application that displays frontend content at the topmost layer of your desktop. This means it overlays a fully transparent, full-featured browser engine window above all your application windows, which provides 100% support for mainstream frontend technologies like HTML/CSS/JS, enabling personalized content development based on these standard web technologies.</p>","developers":["LittleFox"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3601880","name":"Forepaper Engine"},"genres":[{"description":"Accounting","id":"50"},{"description":"Animation & Modeling","id":"51"},{"description":"Audio Production","id":"52"},{"description":"Design & Illustration","id":"53"},{"description":"Education","id":"54"},{"description":"Photo